# ==============================================================================
# 《诡秘世界》(World of Mysteries) - Git 忽略规则规范 (.gitignore)
#
# 技术栈架构:
#   - macOS 宿主应用: SwiftUI (macOS 26+), Xcode 27+, Swift 6+ SPM
#   - 本地引擎服务: Python 3.14.7 (standard GIL), uv, pytest, AgentScope 2.0.8
#   - 数据内核: SQLite (canon.db, world.db, retrieval.db, runtime.db)
#   - 运行时通信: UDS IPC, NDJSON, 32-bit length prefixed framing
# ==============================================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. 操作系统与环境垃圾文件 (OS & Filesystem Metadata)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
Icon\r
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. Swift, Xcode 与 SPM (macOS 宿主应用构建产物与用户临时状态)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SPM 构建与解析缓存
.build/
Packages/
Package.pins
Package.resolved

# Xcode 用户特定数据与断点、视窗排版 (绝不入库)
*.xcuserstate
xcuserdata/
**/xcuserdata/

# Xcode 共享配置保护 (保留 project.pbxproj 与 sharedData)
*.xcodeproj/*
!*.xcodeproj/project.pbxproj
!*.xcodeproj/xcshareddata/
!*.xcodeproj/project.xcworkspace/
!*.xcodeproj/project.xcworkspace/contents.xcworkspacedata
!*.xcodeproj/project.xcworkspace/xcshareddata/

*.xcworkspace/*
!*.xcworkspace/contents.xcworkspacedata
!*.xcworkspace/xcshareddata/

# 编译中间产物与符号文件
DerivedData/
*.moved-builder
*.hmap
*.ipa
*.app
*.dSYM.zip
*.dSYM

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 3. Python 运行时与虚拟环境 (Python 3.14+ / uv / AgentScope)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so

# uv 与虚拟环境
.venv
.venv/
**/.venv
**/.venv/**
env/
venv/
ENV/
*.egg-info/
dist/
build/
.eggs/
*.egg
.uv/

# Python 工具链缓存与测试覆盖率报告
.mypy_cache/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.hypothesis/
.coverage
.coverage.*
htmlcov/
coverage.xml
nosetests.xml

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 4. SQLite 与本地数据库文件 (不变量 10 & 11: 动态数据绝不入库)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 运行期持久化数据库及其 WAL/SHM 事务锁日志 (严禁提交)
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.sqlite-wal
*.sqlite-shm

# 保留契约定义与数据迁移 SQL 脚本
!contracts/**/*.sql
!engine/**/migrations/*.sql
!fixtures/**/*.sql

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 5. Local Engine 运行时临时产物、套接字与日志 (Runtime & IPC)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.log
logs/
run/
outbox/
tmp/
scratch/
assets/temp/
assets/generated/
# IPC Unix Domain Socket 套接字文件
*.sock
*.socket

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 6. 本地 Agent、IDE 与安全凭据 (Security & Local Configs)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 环境变量与 API Key 凭据 (Keychain 为主，严禁明文入库)
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# IDE 配置
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# Agent 本地运行时痕迹与临时目录
.agent/
.agents/scratch/
.gemini/
